156	          <h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#1a1a1a">New waitlist signup</h2>
157	          <p style="color:#374151;line-height:1.6">A customer just joined the waitlist for ZIP code <strong>${zipCode}</strong>.</p>
158	          <table style="margin:16px 0;border-collapse:collapse">
